Unprotected Admin Functionality with Unpredictable URL
Summary

The admin panel is hidden behind an unpredictable URL, but there is no proper access control. The URL is disclosed in the application's JavaScript source, allowing a normal user to access the admin panel.

Steps
Review the application's page source or JavaScript.
Find the hidden admin panel URL.
Navigate to the disclosed admin URL.
Delete the user carlos.
Impact

A normal user can access admin functionality and perform privileged actions, such as deleting users.

PoC
GET /administrator-panel-yb556 HTTP/2

The admin panel is accessible without admin privileges.

Fix

Implement server-side authorization checks on the admin endpoint. Do not rely on hiding or obscuring the admin URL as a security control.
